监控、灰度发布、容量管理、日志管理、key-value 存储于一体，[官网介绍](http://haomiao.qq.com/index.html#documents)\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/Tencent/MSEC", "stars": 2729, "forks": 724, "watch": 1, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 2, "category_name": "JavaScript 项目", "items": [{"rid": "f829fab1682f48db95e2c0d82518ec62", "name": "N-blog", "full_name": "nswbmw/N-blog", "description": "面向新手的 Node.js 教程，该教程讲述了 Node.js 基本知识点，同时结合搭建一个多人博客的实战，从零基础到实际开发，由浅到深帮助新手入门 Node.js 这门语言\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/nswbmw/N-blog", "stars": 15353, "forks": 4524, "watch": 903, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 1, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "70af219e8d4d46909e41a7e10f37cb0d", "name": "pomelo", "full_name": "NetEase/pomelo", "description": "Pomelo 网易开源的一个 Node.js 游戏服务器框架，[Demo](http://pomelo.netease.com/demo.html)\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/NetEase/pomelo", "stars": 11861, "forks": 2844, "watch": 7, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 1, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "c0845ed0d1994b978fe318ae767b34ca", "name": "vue-hackernews-2.0", "full_name": "vuejs/vue-hackernews-2.0", "description": "这是一个 Vue2.0 示例，克隆 [Hacker News](https://news.ycombinator.com/) 网站（我感觉比原站好看多了😅）\n\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/vuejs/vue-hackernews-2.0", "stars": 10840, "forks": 2104, "watch": 297, "image_path": "/i/xT7doVhF0pf9Hct.png", "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 6, "category_name": "PHP 项目", "items": [{"rid": "a0e7238967f141749afbd21e9dac2678", "name": "VulApps", "full_name": "Medicean/VulApps", "description": "用于快速搭建各种漏洞环境，可用来学习、理解常见的漏洞，增强自己在开发过程的安全意识\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/Medicean/VulApps", "stars": 3779, "forks": 973, "watch": 1, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 1, "category_name": "Python 项目", "items": [{"rid": "a8b3572c72f446d08eb9bcf64321b1e4", "name": "flask-limiter", "full_name": "alisaifee/flask-limiter", "description": "一个 Flask 的扩展库，它可以根据访问者的 IP 限制其访问频率、次数等。示例代码如下：\n```python\nfrom flask import Flask\nfrom flask_limiter import Limiter\nfrom flask_limiter.util import get_remote_address\n\napp = Flask(__name__)\nlimiter = Limiter(\n    app,\n    key_func=get_remote_address,\n    global_limits=[\"2 per minute\", \"1 per second\"],\n)\n\n@app.route(\"/slow\")\n@limiter.limit(\"1 per day\")\ndef slow():\n    return \"24\"\n\n@app.route(\"/fast\")\ndef fast():\n    return \"42\"\n\n@app.route(\"/ping\")\n@limiter.exempt\ndef ping():\n    return 'PONG'\n\napp.run()\n```\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/alisaifee/flask-limiter", "stars": 1207, "forks": 132, "watch": 11, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "d71609b46dae4e53af964a7ab93af7ba", "name": "glances", "full_name": "nicolargo/glances", "description": "一个可以让你**一目了然**你的系统情况（类 (h)top）的工具，它界面友好，安装方便：`pip install glances`\n\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/nicolargo/glances", "stars": 33896, "forks": 1842, "watch": 491, "image_path": "/i/NZSswv3q5h2MVkP.png", "vote_total": 3, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "92cf2bf14a3947b58ea3be76e6bfec5d", "name": "ngrok", "full_name": "inconshreveable/ngrok", "description": "一个十分方便、好用的内网穿透工具，它可以把本地某个端口的服务，通过一个安全隧道，映射到公网的一个地址。同时它提供了一个 Web 页面，展示了每个请求、响应的所有信息，便于调试本地的程序。基本的使用方法如下：\n```\nngrok 协议 本地服务监听的端口\nngrok http 8000\n\n创建成功会返回公网地址，然后通过该地址就可以访问到本地的服务。\n本地访问 http://localhost:4040，就可以查看关于每个请求、响应的相关数据\n```\n\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/inconshreveable/ngrok", "stars": 24387, "forks": 4245, "watch": 3, "image_path": "/i/GXwFAKaN79sUnu3.png", "vote_total": 3, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 10, "category_name": "Swift 项目", "items": [{"rid": "e2ba8c6839e843bca2215efdea936107", "name": "Kingfisher", "full_name": "onevcat/Kingfisher", "description": "Kingfisher 是一个异步下载和缓存图片的库，你可以把它看做 SDWebImage 的纯 Swift 实现和替代。它可以帮助简单地实现像是用户头像或者 table view 里面的图片的下载和缓存这样的工作，以提高 app 速度和帮助开发者节省时间，[作者的中文博客](http://project.onevcat.com/)\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/onevcat/Kingfisher", "stars": 24404, "forks": 2771, "watch": 357, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 1, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 15, "category_name": "人工智能", "items": [{"rid": "a45bc89ff9af459ab3647742c05c0a00", "name": "machine-learning-for-software-engineers", "full_name": "ZuzooVn/machine-learning-for-software-engineers", "description": "自上而下的学习路线，软件工程师的机器学习，[中文版](https://github.com/ZuzooVn/machine-learning-for-software-engineers/blob/master/README-zh-CN.md)\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/ZuzooVn/machine-learning-for-software-engineers", "stars": 28880, "forks": 6144, "watch": 1474, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 3, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}]}, {"category_id": 5, "category_name": "其它", "items": [{"rid": "d10665536fa14e7e840588961556b74b", "name": "best-chinese-front-end-blogs", "full_name": "FrankFang/best-chinese-front-end-blogs", "description": "该项目是收集优质的中文前端博客\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/FrankFang/best-chinese-front-end-blogs", "stars": 3890, "forks": 616, "watch": 305, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 1, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "1c85385d34194cf585229d66baae045f", "name": "freecodecamp.cn", "full_name": "FreeCodeCampChina/freecodecamp.cn", "description": "freecodecamp 是一个自由的开源编程社区，[freecodecamp 中文社区](https://freecodecamp.cn)\n\n", "description_en": null, "github_url": "https://github.com/FreeCodeCampChina/freecodecamp.cn", "stars": 37790, "forks": 1415, "watch": 780, "image_path": null, "vote_total": 0, "publish_at": "2016-12-28T08:15:00"}, {"rid": "4d311f59821944c6ae2a00c0f1ce55b0", "name": "golang-open-source-pro